並納其善。奐訥於造次而敏於當宮，軍民稱之。黃武五年，權攻石陽，奐以地主，使所部將軍鮮于丹帥五千人先斷淮道。自帥吳碩、張梁五千人為軍前鋒，降高城，得三將。大軍引還，權詔使在前住，駕過其軍，見奐軍陳整齊，權歎曰：「初吾憂其遲鈍，今治軍，諸將少能及者，吾無憂矣。」拜揚威將軍，封沙羨侯。吳碩、張梁皆裨將軍，賜爵關內侯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"孫奐","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"季明","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"皎","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"皎","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"劉靖","kind":"person","person_id":"qfh_ozo_ufz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"李允","kind":"person","person_id":"yru_r4u_u6m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"吳碩","kind":"person","person_id":"lj9_p80_o5s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"張梁","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_v9x_up1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"閭舉","kind":"person","person_id":"vqw_kae_8k5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surfa